===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|quadruple}}, from {{der|en|la|quadruplus}}. Can be analyzed as {{suffix|en|quadri-|-ple}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkwɒd.ɹʊ.pəl/|/kwɒˈdɹuː.pəl/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/kwɑˈdɹu.pəl/|/kwɑˈdɹʌp.əl/|/ˈkwɑd.ɹə.pəl/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-quadruple.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|uːpəl|s=3}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Being [[four]] times as long, as big or as many of something.
#: {{ux|en|He's quite an athlete and can do '''quadruple''' jumps with ease.}}

====Antonyms====
